The files are in fixtures/vendor/coe/Workflows/ and are unmodified upstream
bytes; fixtures/vendor/coe/MANIFEST.json records each file's upstream path and
SHA-256, and the test suite verifies those hashes on every run.

GitHub reports the CoE Starter Kit's licence as NOASSERTION. That is an artefact
of its LICENSE file being indented, which defeats GitHub's licence detector. The
file is the MIT licence, reproduced below verbatim from that commit.

